<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐχο-τομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut in twain: bisect</i> a line, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.28.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				913b31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος -ηθέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of the medial raphe of the perineum, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.62
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>punish with the last severity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				24.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>divide into two</i> (logically), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				302e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				642b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				644b19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> intr., of the
			moon, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.929f
			</span></i>.</div>
